<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pittheus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dissyl.</span></b> ), ĕi and ĕos,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πιτθεύς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>king of
				Trœzen</i>, <i>son of Pelops</i>, <i>and father of Æthra</i>, <i>the mother of Theseus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 8,
				622</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab. 37</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pitthēus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Pittheus</i>, <i>Pitthean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pitthea Troezen,</span>”
				<i>ruled by Pittheus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 15, 296</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">506</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pit-thēïus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>Pitthean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Troezen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					6, 418</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. H.
					4, 107</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pitthēis</span></b> ,
				ĭdos, f., <i>the Pittheïd</i>, <i>daughter of
				Pittheus</i>, i. e. <i>Æthra</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pittheidos Aethrae filius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					H. 10, 131</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
